<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>{{ inventory_hostname }} · Platform Automation Lab</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #1a1d21;
      --surface: #252a30;
      --surface-elevated: #2e343c;
      --text: #e8eaed;
      --text-muted: #9aa0a6;
      --accent: #5c9ce6;
      --accent-soft: rgba(92, 156, 230, 0.15);
      --border: #3d444d;
      --success: #6bcf7f;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: "Segoe UI", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--text);
      background: linear-gradient(160deg, #14171a 0%, var(--bg) 40%, #1e2328 100%);
    }

    .wrap {
      max-width: 44rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 3rem;
    }

    header { margin-bottom: 1.75rem; }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
      background: var(--accent-soft);
      border: 1px solid rgba(92, 156, 230, 0.35);
      padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
      font-size: 1.85rem;
      font-weight: 650;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      line-height: 1.25;
    }

    .lead {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .card h2 {
      margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .arch-flow {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem 0.35rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .arch-node {
      background: var(--surface-elevated);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 0.4rem 0.65rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: var(--text);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .arch-node.highlight {
      border-color: rgba(92, 156, 230, 0.5);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--accent-soft);
    }

    .arch-arrow { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }

    .arch-note {
      margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    ul.evidence, ul.ops {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 1.2rem;
    }

    ul.evidence li, ul.ops li { margin-bottom: 0.55rem; }
    ul.evidence li::marker, ul.ops li::marker { color: var(--accent); }

    .meta-grid { display: grid; gap: 0.65rem; }

    .meta-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
      align-items: baseline;
    }

    .meta-label {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      min-width: 6.5rem;
    }

    .meta-value {
      font-family: ui-monospace, "Cascadia Code", monospace;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .status {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      color: var(--success);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .status::before {
      content: "";
      width: 0.5rem;
      height: 0.5rem;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--success);
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--success);
    }

    table.stack {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    table.stack th,
    table.stack td {
      text-align: left;
      padding: 0.45rem 0.5rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    table.stack th {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-weight: 600;
      width: 38%;
    }

    table.stack tr:last-child th,
    table.stack tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }

    a {
      color: var(--accent);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    footer {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-align: center;
    }

    code {
      font-size: 0.85em;
      background: var(--surface-elevated);
      padding: 0.12rem 0.4rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <span class="badge">Cloud / platform engineering lab</span>
      <h1>RHEL Ansible Web Lab</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Ansible provisions identical app servers from a Git-backed control host—one playbook,
        inventory-driven targets, hardened firewall rules, and a verified HTTP endpoint on each node.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>Architecture</h2>
      <div class="arch-flow" aria-label="Lab topology">
        <span class="arch-node">Control-Node</span>
        <span class="arch-arrow">→ SSH →</span>
        <span class="arch-node">App-Node1</span>
        <span class="arch-arrow">·</span>
        <span class="arch-node">App-Node2</span>
      </div>
      <p class="arch-note">
        <strong>GitHub</strong> (source of truth) → pull on control host →
        <code>ansible-playbook playbooks/site.yml</code> →
        <code>{{ web_stack }}</code> + <code>firewalld</code> (http/https) on each <code>[webservers]</code> host.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>What I implemented</h2>
      <ul class="evidence">
        <li><strong>Inventory-driven scale-out:</strong> group <code>[webservers]</code> targets multiple nodes; the same playbook configures each app server without manual steps.</li>
        <li><strong>Non-interactive automation:</strong> dedicated <code>ansible</code> user, SSH key auth, and passwordless <code>sudo</code> so runs do not depend on typed passwords.</li>
        <li><strong>Idempotent roles:</strong> <code>common</code> (baseline packages) and <code>webserver</code> ({{ web_stack }}, service enable, templated content, firewall services).</li>
        <li><strong>One-command deploy:</strong> <code>ansible-playbook playbooks/site.yml</code> from the control host reproduces the full stack on every app node.</li>
        <li><strong>Change discipline:</strong> commits on Windows → push to GitHub → <code>git pull</code> on Control-Node before each automation run.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>Operations practices</h2>
      <ul class="ops">
        <li><strong>Health checks:</strong> <code>ansible webservers -m ping</code> and HTTP verification on port 80 for each target.</li>
        <li><strong>Idempotency:</strong> re-running the playbook should report mostly <code>ok</code> with minimal <code>changed</code> tasks.</li>
        <li><strong>Security baseline:</strong> least-privilege automation account, <code>firewalld</code> allows only required services (ssh, http, https).</li>
        <li><strong>Per-host proof:</strong> this page is templated per inventory hostname—you are viewing the instance that answered for <strong>{{ inventory_hostname }}</strong>.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>This host</h2>
      <div class="meta-grid">
        <div class="meta-row">
          <span class="meta-label">Hostname</span>
          <span class="meta-value">{{ inventory_hostname }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-row">
          <span class="meta-label">Address</span>
          <span class="meta-value">{{ ansible_host | default(ansible_default_ipv4.address | default('n/a')) }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-row">
          <span class="meta-label">Web stack</span>
          <span class="meta-value">{{ web_stack }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-row">
          <span class="meta-label">HTTP status</span>
          <span class="meta-value"><span class="status">Serving on port 80</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-row">
          <span class="meta-label">Last deploy</span>
          <span class="meta-value">{{ ansible_date_time.date }} {{ ansible_date_time.time }} ({{ ansible_date_time.tz }})</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>Tech stack</h2>
      <table class="stack">
        <tr><th>Hypervisor</th><td>Oracle VirtualBox (bridged lab network)</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Operating system</th><td>RHEL {{ ansible_distribution_major_version | default('9') }}</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Automation</th><td>Ansible Core — roles <code>common</code>, <code>webserver</code></td></tr>
        <tr><th>Web tier</th><td>{{ web_stack }} (reverse-proxy ready pattern)</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Firewall</th><td>firewalld — http / https</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Source control</th><td>Git / GitHub (<code>Projects</code> repository)</td></tr>
      </table>
    </section>

    <footer>
      Portfolio lab · Linux+ &amp; Security+ foundation · NOC operations background · targeting cloud / platform engineering roles
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
